### register
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Osmani Lopez",
    "occupation": "Especialista Principal",
    "email": "esprrhh@fevex.cu",
    "idArea": 5,
    "username": "esprrhh",
    "password": "12345678",
    "idRole": 1
}

### update
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/auth/users/6b4f78c0-efee-11ef-a14b-dbf1a2c78c20/update HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
    "occupation": "Directora RRHH",
    "email": "dir.rrhh@fevex.cu",
    "idArea": 7,
    "username": "dirrrhh",
    "oldPassword": "12345678",
    "newPassword": "12345678",
    "idRole": 3
}

### login
